  "math_structure": {
    "type": "symmetric_matrix_quadratic_form",
    "template": "对称矩阵 $A$ 的二次型 $x^T(aE-A)x$ 半正定当且仅当 $aE-A$ 的所有特征值非负，即 $a \\geq \\max(\\lambda_i(A))$",
    "variable_count": 3
  },
  "difficulty": 3,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "(i) 求特征值",
      "steps": [
        "特征多项式：$\\det(A - \\lambda E) = \\det\\begin{pmatrix} -\\lambda & 2 & 7 \\\\ 2 & -\\lambda & 2 \\\\ 7 & 2 & -\\lambda \\end{pmatrix}$",
        "按第一行展开：",
        "$= -\\lambda \\det\\begin{pmatrix} -\\lambda & 2 \\\\ 2 & -\\lambda \\end{pmatrix} - 2\\det\\begin{pmatrix} 2 & 2 \\\\ 7 & -\\lambda \\end{pmatrix} + 7\\det\\begin{pmatrix} 2 & -\\lambda \\\\ 7 & 2 \\end{pmatrix}$",
        "$= -\\lambda(\\lambda^2 - 4) - 2(-2\\lambda - 14) + 7(4 + 7\\lambda)$",
        "$= -\\lambda^3 + 4\\lambda + 4\\lambda + 28 + 28 + 49\\lambda$",
        "$= -\\lambda^3 + 57\\lambda + 56$",
        "特征方程：$\\lambda^3 - 57\\lambda - 56 = 0$",
        "试根 $\\lambda = 8$：$512 - 456 - 56 = 0$ ✓",
        "因式分解：$\\lambda^3 - 57\\lambda - 56 = (\\lambda - 8)(\\lambda^2 + 8\\lambda + 7) = (\\lambda - 8)(\\lambda + 1)(\\lambda + 7)$",
        "**特征值**：$\\lambda_1 = 8, \\lambda_2 = -1, \\lambda_3 = -7$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "(ii) 求 $a$ 的范围",
      "steps": [
        "$aE - A$ 的特征值为 $a - \\lambda_i$（$i=1,2,3$）",
        "要使 ${}^tx(aE-A)x \\geq 0$ 对所有 $x \\in \\mathbb{R}^3$ 成立，$aE-A$ 必须半正定",
        "这要求所有特征值 $\\geq 0$：",
        "- $a - 8 \\geq 0 \\Rightarrow a \\geq 8$",
        "- $a - (-1) \\geq 0 \\Rightarrow a \\geq -1$",
        "- $a - (-7) \\geq 0 \\Rightarrow a \\geq -7$",
        "取最严格的条件：**$a \\geq 8$**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "(iii) 求 ${}^tx(aE-A)x=0$ 的解",
      "steps": [
        "当 $a \\geq 8$ 时，$aE - A$ 至少有一个特征值为 0（当 $a=8$ 时）",
        "对于 $a = 8$，矩阵 $8E - A = \\begin{pmatrix} 8 & -2 & -7 \\\\ -2 & 8 & -2 \\\\ -7 & -2 & 8 \\end{pmatrix}$",
        "求 ${}^tx(8E-A)x = 0$ 的 $x$，等价于求 $Ax = 8x$ 的特征向量",
        "$(A - 8E)v = 0$，即 $\\begin{pmatrix} -8 & 2 & 7 \\\\ 2 & -8 & 2 \\\\ 7 & 2 & -8 \\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix} v_1 \\\\ v_2 \\\\ v_3 \\end{pmatrix} = 0$",
        "行化简：第1行 $\\div (-1)$：$8v_1 - 2v_2 - 7v_3 = 0$",
        "第2行：$2v_1 - 8v_2 + 2v_3 = 0$ → $v_1 - 4v_2 + v_3 = 0$",
        "第3行：$7v_1 + 2v_2 - 8v_3 = 0$",
        "从第2式：$v_1 = 4v_2 - v_3$",
        "代入第1式：$8(4v_2 - v_3) - 2v_2 - 7v_3 = 0$ → $32v_2 - 8v_3 - 2v_2 - 7v_3 = 0$ → $30v_2 = 15v_3$ → $v_2 = \\frac{v_3}{2}$",
        "取 $v_3 = 2$，则 $v_2 = 1, v_1 = 4 - 2 = 2$",
        "特征向量：$v = \\begin{pmatrix} 2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2 \\end{pmatrix}$（或其任意非零标量倍数）",
        "**对于 $a = 8$**：$x = t\\begin{pmatrix} 2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2 \\end{pmatrix}$，$t \\in \\mathbb{R}$",
        "**对于 $a > 8$**：$aE - A$ 正定（无零特征值），仅 $x = 0$ 满足 ${}^tx(aE-A)x = 0$"
      ]
    }
  ],
