        "type": "symmetric_all_ones_off_diagonal",
        "template": "矩阵元素为全 0 对角线、全 1 非对角线，特征值为 $2, -1, -1$",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 3,
      "estimated_minutes": 8,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "求特征值与正定性范围",
          "steps": [
            "特征多项式：$\\det(D-\\lambda E) = \\det\\begin{pmatrix} -\\lambda & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -\\lambda & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & -\\lambda \\end{pmatrix}$",
            "$= -\\lambda(\\lambda^2-1) - 1(-\\lambda-1) + 1(1+\\lambda)$",
            "$= -\\lambda^3 + \\lambda + \\lambda + 1 + 1 + \\lambda = -\\lambda^3 + 3\\lambda + 2$",
            "$= -(\\lambda^3 - 3\\lambda - 2) = -(\\lambda - 2)(\\lambda^2 + 2\\lambda + 1) = -(\\lambda-2)(\\lambda+1)^2$",
            "特征值：$\\lambda_1 = 2, \\lambda_2 = \\lambda_3 = -1$",
            "(ii) $\\mu E - D$ 正定需所有特征值 $> 0$，即 $\\mu - 2 > 0$ 且 $\\mu - (-1) > 0$",
            "需 $\\mu > 2$（更严格的条件）",
            "**答案**：$\\mu > 2$"
